#: ../../source/docs/interlink-emulation.rst:5
#: f8962916a8d8433abbc98289fc29c987
msgid "Interlink Simulator Controller Emulation with OpenTX"
msgstr "使用 OpenTX 模拟 Interlink 仿真器控制器"

#: ../../source/docs/interlink-emulation.rst:7
#: 51a1b957392a45fbaba2cd0f3706d58f
msgid ""
"It is possible to closely emulate the Interlink DX or Elite with an OpenTX "
"transmitter in RealFlight. This allows using your existing OpenTX "
"transmitter if RealFlight software only is purchased. Since the ArduPilot "
"SITL models for use with RealFlight assume that an Interlink DX is being "
"used, setting up your OpenTX transmitter to exactly emulate it prevents "
"having to change any transmitter settings for its use."
msgstr ""
"可以在 RealFlight 中使用 OpenTX 发射机精确模拟 Interlink DX 或 Elite。如果只购买了 RealFlight "
"软件，则可以使用现有的 OpenTX 发射机。由于用于 RealFlight 的 ArduPilot SITL（软件在环仿真）模型假定使用 "
"Interlink DX，因此将您的 OpenTX 发射机设置为完全模拟 Interlink DX，就无需再更改发射机设置。"

