#: ../../source/docs/interlink-emulation.rst:52
#: 65cef0be822f48c7aa10719769e8ced4
msgid ""
"Set up a model in the Transmitter as a model named SIM and program the mixes"
" as below using 100% throws/gains, and no offsets, curves, etc depending on "
"which Interlink controller you wish to mimic. Turn off the internal RF "
"section to conserve power."
msgstr ""
"在发射机中创建一个名为 SIM 的模型，并根据您希望模拟的 Interlink 控制器，按如下方式设置混控，使用 100% "
"行程/增益，不设置任何偏移量、曲线等。关闭内部射频模块以节省电量。"

#: ../../source/docs/interlink-emulation.rst:55
#: 04aea3633ae346c09f19548819391791
msgid ""
"These most closely mimic the Interlink controllers' physical layout. Of "
"course, you can map any OpenTX control/switch to any channel you desire, if "
"you wish a different layout than the Interlink controller."
msgstr ""
"这些设置最接近 Interlink 控制器的实体布局。当然，如果您希望使用不同于 Interlink 控制器的布局，也可以将任意 OpenTX "
"控制/开关映射到任意通道。"

