#: ../../source/docs/interlink-emulation.rst:94
#: 2428de690b7141058ecb40f147a28b6c
msgid ""
"If you are using a QX7, then you will need to use S1 instead of SE as the "
"mode channel (8) if emulating an Interlink DX. Since there is no SG switch, "
"you will not have channel 11."
msgstr ""
"如果您使用的是 QX7，在模拟 Interlink DX 时需要使用 S1 代替 SE 作为飞行模式通道（8）。由于没有 SG 开关，将没有通道 11。"

#: ../../source/docs/interlink-emulation.rst:97
#: 86a94073c1f24ae2830596c2c971ad47
msgid ""
"Currently, when using any controller with SITL flightaxis in RealFlight, "
"only the first 8 channels are passed to the SITL (soon will be upgraded to "
"the first 12), but higher channels can be still used in normal RealFlight "
"simulations, if the model uses them."
msgstr ""
"目前，在 RealFlight 中使用任何控制器配合 SITL flightaxis 时，只有前 8 个通道会传递给 SITL（即将升级到前 12 "
"个通道），但更高编号的通道仍可在普通 RealFlight 仿真中使用（如果模型用到了这些通道）。"

#: ../../source/docs/interlink-emulation.rst:100
#: 2df669fdf2a746e0a0d73b67fc6dabad
msgid ""
"Pre-configured OpenTX .otx files for Taranis 9D, QX7, and Horus style "
"transmitters are available `here "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot_wiki/tree/master/scripts/OpenTX_configs>`_."
msgstr ""
"适用于 Taranis 9D、QX7 和 Horus 风格发射机的预配置 OpenTX .otx 文件可从 `此处 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot_wiki/tree/master/scripts/OpenTX_configs>`_"
" 获取。"
